{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015880/extras/0d6d1404a100cce1802ebfc815c9264e.poster.avif?t=1760968220\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015880/extras/0d6d1404a100cce1802ebfc815c9264e.webm?t=1760968220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015880/extras/0d6d1404a100cce1802ebfc815c9264e.mp4?t=1760968220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silkdown follows the classic arena shooter tradition with a few twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a spider-like war machine that has some special abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command troops - throw a beacon that can target a position or enemy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave web - place the deadly silk between the walls and trap your opponents.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 to 4 players in local multiplayer couch combat or online using Steam Remote Play (or other similar service).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic arena twin-stick shooter gameplay combined with squad control and web weaving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn fast paced combat with a high skill ceiling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loads of weapons, power ups and arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules and balancing customization.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Join us on discord and be part of the development process and community.\u00a0</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015880/extras/95224af0a03a1c39d4b450316d185fbc.avif?t=1760968220\" width=516 height=125 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015880?t=1760968220","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015880?t=1760968220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015880/8acb11e2475d372d233d3e7e0486556456149505/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760968220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015880/8acb11e2475d372d233d3e7e0486556456149505/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760968220","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015880/extras/0d6d1404a100cce1802ebfc815c9264e.poster.avif?t=1760968220\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015880/extras/0d6d1404a100cce1802ebfc815c9264e.webm?t=1760968220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"ht